WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.714 --> 00:00:08.534
Are your expenses in an Excel workbook? Import them from the project page.

2
00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:16.392
Click “Import”, then choose the dossier that will receive the lines.

3
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:23.797
Required columns: N°ORDRE, DATE, TEAM, OWNER, LIBELLE DES TRANSACTIONS, DEPENSES.

4
00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:28.519
TEAM must be the dossier's team, and the dossier your own draft.

5
00:00:28.519 --> 00:00:36.881
Simulate first: nothing is written, you see what would be created.

6
00:00:36.881 --> 00:00:44.378
With no error, turn the simulation off, then click “Import”.

7
00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:50.250
The lines arrive as drafts: “Open the dossier” shows them.

8
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:56.487
Upload each line's document; then submit the dossier.
